  "structural_change": "Native TP8 partition: die lead accepted TWO UCIe P/R channels in each direction plus three SerDes directions,10 hardened W546 leaves. P and SerDes546, R514 zero-padded32, unchanged credit CDC PIPE2, own writer/reader roots, kept pin capture/launch. No serializer, lost bit, clock relaxation or repricing. Dense86.4x129.6 leaf targets<=15000sinks/root; CTS gate required. n1 terminal FLOORPLAN_MARGIN hold-buffer area67.1%; n2 grows width to90.72um (hold allowance63.7%) without changing RTL or port ranges.",
